        {
          "id": 558177275,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "The 'Enable mouse-over colorization' preference, like the other checkbox preferences from the Layout preferences panel and like the 'Colorize Packet List' button are \"stable\" per profile and are saved to the current profile's preferences file. Interestingly the initial state of the 'Auto Scroll in Live Capture' button is set to the current profile's Capture preference panel's 'Automatic Scrolling in Live Capture' checkbox. But changes to the 'Auto Scroll in Live Capture' button state are not saved to the current profile.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6682068,
            "username": "jim.young",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Jim Young",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/db9ae68fc706b78b6724093efb95f64d89ef17c6d9b3eb4b3d632bf196ff78fb?s=80&d=identicon",
